ction without requiring manual interaction whenever possible.\n\nExample:\n\n* Open ChatGPT → Quantumult X automatically connects.\n* Open Claude → Quantumult X automatically connects.\n* Leave those apps → Quantumult X can optionally disconnect.\n\nThis would greatly improve user experience and reduce repetitive manual actions.\n\nThank you for considering this feature.","rating":4,"reviewerName":"zhangyukangyu","dateAuthorText":"* null * · zhangyukangyu","moreAction":{"title":"Ratings & Reviews","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[],"custom":{}},"$kind":"flowAction","actionClass":"FlowAction","page":"reviews","pageData":{"shelves":[{"$kind":"Shelf","impressionMetrics":{"fields":{"id":"2","name":"","impressionType":"ratingsDetails","idType":"sequential","impressionIndex":0}},"contentType":"reviews","marker":null,"items":[{"$kind":"Review","id":"14176500874","title":"需要快捷指令","date":"2026-06-13T04:41:14.000Z","dateText":"* null *","contents":"Feature Request: Auto Connect Quantumult X via Shortcuts / Automation\n\nI would like Quantumult X to support automation through Apple Shortcuts.\n\nCurrent situation:\nEvery time I want to use apps such as ChatGPT, Claude, X (Twitter), Gemini, or other apps that require a proxy connection, I need to manually open Quantumult X and tap the VPN button. This becomes repetitive and inconvenient.\n\nRequested features:\n\n1. Add a Shortcut action to connect/disconnect Quantumult X.\n2. Allow iOS Automation to automatically connect Quantumult X when specific apps are opened.\n3. Allow Quantumult X to respond to system VPN actions or URL schemes for connection control.\n4. Support background connection without requiring manual interaction whenever possible.\n\nExample:\n\n* Open ChatGPT → Quantumult X automatically connects.\n* Open Claude → Quantumult X automatically connects.\n* Leave those apps → Quantumult X can optionally disconnect.\n\nThis would greatly improve user experience and reduce repet